    "detailed_description": "You are the best pilot, survivor, this is your last mission and everything will be finished. But in the middle of the mission, strange ships appear, a greater threat has arrived and the conflict seems to change course, now you are no longer fighting for a nation, it is the beginning of something much bigger and now you are the first defense barrier without even know.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n! 6 frantic stages<br />\r\n! 5 Epic bosses at the end of the stage<br />\r\n! Beautiful hand drawn pixel art environment<br />\r\n! A retro 3:4 resolution (vertical shoot em up)<br />\r\n! A challenging path without contines<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRED TITANS is a single player vertical shoot em up, you will have to end the threat by creating a strategy with the available resources, you will have to be very skillful since there are no continues, but you will be able to recover lives at certain times.",
